<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>ICT Excellence Certificate</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>

<body>
  <main class="container">
    <h1>Excellence Certificate</h1>

    <p class="lead">
      Congratulations to my students who earned at least one excellence badge.
      Your effort, consistency, and focus deserve to be celebrated!
    </p>

    <p class="kind-note">
      Kind note: to keep it fair and motivating for everyone, please choose your name only if you have at least one
      excellence badge.
      If your name is not in this list yet, your moment is coming too. Keep going.
    </p>

    <section class="honor-section">
      <h2>Semester Badge Winners</h2>
      <p>
        Huge congratulations to our top badge achievers of the semester, including the final exam results.
      </p>

      <div class="winner-grid">
        <div class="winner-card gold">
          <h3>Adil Orujov</h3>
          <p>10A1</p>
        </div>

        <div class="winner-card gold">
          <h3>Leyla Aliyeva</h3>
          <p>10A1</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="honor-section">
      <h2>Final Exam Excellence</h2>
      <p>
        Congratulations to the students who achieved the maximum score in the final exam.
      </p>

      <div class="winner-grid">
        <div class="winner-card">
          <h3>Shafiga Abdullayeva</h3>
          <p>10B2</p>
        </div>

        <div class="winner-card">
          <h3>Ayan Mammadova</h3>
          <p>10A2</p>
        </div>

        <div class="winner-card">
          <h3>Aysu Sadayeva</h3>
          <p>10B1</p>
        </div>

        <div class="winner-card">
          <h3>Zahid Gadirov</h3>
          <p>10B3</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <p class="semester-note">
      Thank you everyone for your hard work. Keep learning, keep improving, and shine even brighter in the next
      semester.
    </p>

    <form action="/certificate" method="POST">
      <select name="studentId" required>
        <option value="">Choose your name</option>

        <% students.forEach(student=> { %>
          <option value="<%= student.id %>">
            <%= student.name %>
          </option>
          <% }) %>
      </select>

      <button type="submit">View Certificate</button>
    </form>
  </main>
  <footer>Made with JS and <span>❤</span> by kamrandroid</footer>
</body>

</html>